<?php $cards=array(array('Kuota',$quota>0?$fmt($quota):'—','dark','Alokasi pesanan pada periode'),array('Realisasi',$fmt($stock['out']),'','DO selesai, BA/RDT, dan BASTB'),array('Realisasi (%)',$quota>0?$fmt($stock['out']/$quota*100,1).'%':'—','blue','Terhadap alokasi pesanan'),array('Sisa',$quota>0?$fmt($quota-$stock['out']):'—','','Kuota dikurangi realisasi'),array('Stock In',$fmt($stock['in']),'','Penerimaan + pencatatan saldo awal'),array('Stock Out',$fmt($stock['out']),'orange','DO selesai, BA/RDT, dan BASTB'),array('Quantity Available',$fmt($stock['closing']),'','Saldo hingga '.$end),array('Daily Throughput (DOT)',$fmt($stock['out']/$days,2),'red','Rata-rata liter / hari kalender'));foreach(array_chunk($cards,4) as $row): ?><div class="row kpi-row"><?php foreach($row as $c): ?><div class="col-md-3 col-sm-6"><div class="kpi-card <?= $c[2] ?>"><div class="title"><?= $c[0] ?></div><div class="value"><?= $c[1] ?></div><small><?= html_escape($c[3]) ?></small></div></div><?php endforeach; ?></div><?php endforeach; ?>
